      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Credential: Local protected key-admin method; no online vault retrieval dependency.\nDelegation: Local key authority approves rotation/recovery with validity bounds.\nRevoke — Independent local key authority: Remove key-admin access and rotate/reissue within approved safe recovery plan.\nTiming/residual: Site-specific; untested. Offline trust/revocation distribution and old signatures require reconciliation.",
      "originalText": "Credential: Local protected key-admin method; no online vault retrieval dependency.\nDelegation: Local key authority approves rotation/recovery with validity bounds.\nRevoke — Independent local key authority: Remove key-admin access and rotate/reissue within approved safe recovery plan.\nTiming/residual: Site-specific; untested. Offline trust/revocation distribution and old signatures require reconciliation.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 2.5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false
